{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"             \n \n \n \n こんにちは\n \n 東京都出身　二期生\n \n 松平璃子です🐰\n \n \n 今回のブログは前回書いた\n 「自分セルフプロドュース」で\n 自分が思うカワイイをピンクのバラ🥀で\n フィルムカメラで撮影してみました♡\n \n 自分でメイクとか服装とかお花選ぶの\n 楽しかったな〜〜\n プロの方々には敵わないけど自分なりに頑張りました笑\n \n \n \n \n 欅坂46、櫻坂46、で活動していた期間は\n 夢想していたような日々でした。\n 生まれ変わっても欅坂46に加入して\n 二期生に入りたいです。\n \n \n \n 最後に\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFZ8HPPWV18WWXRHB5A7CGZ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFZ8K6F2HXPE1JMQGW6ZRDX","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFZ8NM89VTN1XET367XNDP4","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFZ8QME26ECH842P70B17P9","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n 20歳の頃に撮影でお花を持たせていただいた時に\n またいつか花と自分で写真撮りたいなーと思ってたので嬉しいです💐\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFZ8S2BP3DXPPH9WQCYT3M9","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFZ8TFV8MM8QREHXA0M1J72","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFZ8W3RZQFHQRK6JAGWTKBD","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFZ8XQRMTXSCQMFJ2VP27GE","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFZ90P6X4RJ4ZE6FHRQ7E3B","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFZ925NSKV8HPAXZ06FKKA7","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFZ94EB9ASPNQRWNTFSG1V4","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n これが私の貪欲にカワイイを追求\n 自分ウケかな、、！\n これからもカワイイに敏感に貪欲に\n 松平らしく生きていきたいです。\n \n \n あと２日間よろしくお願いします☺️\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFZ96244W5J9CPPSKY4H8BM","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 出会えて幸せでした。\n \n 松平璃子             "}],"source":"archive"}